blocks.en:
Query and answers are vectorized via scikit-learn’s TfidfVectorizer Pedregosa et al. (2011) ; Sparck Jones (1972) ;
similarity is the cosine between query and answer vectors, also
deterministic, but normalizing document length differently from BM25.

blocks.zh:
通过Scikit-learn的TfidfVectorizer Pedregosa等人(2011年);Sparck Jones(1972年);
相似性是查询和回答向量之间的余弦,也
决定性,但文档长度正常化与BM25不同.

